TECHNIQUE FILE - EARTH GRUDGE FEAR (KAKUZU)
The immortality of the treasurer. Origin: forbidden technique stolen from his village.

Kakuzu's body is bound by thousands of black threads that can detach, extend, and
reassemble his limbs at range. The same threads let him steal the still-living heart
of a slain enemy and stitch it into himself.

- Five hearts: Kakuzu carries up to five hearts, each of a different chakra nature
  (Fire, Wind, Lightning, Earth, Water). To kill him you must destroy every heart;
  each is a separate life. This is the source of his "immortality."
- Masks: the spare hearts are housed in beast-like masks on his back that detach as
  independent constructs, each firing an elemental mass-attack of its nature.
- Threads: used to bind, impale, repair his own body, and puppeteer at distance.

He does not tire and does not age as others do. He has outlived generations of partners.
Deny him fresh hearts and grind down the five he holds; there is no shortcut.
